<title>UK: Deutsche sets 200 bln lire bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets 200 bln lire bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NV CURACAO</p>
<p>GUARANTOR DEUTSCHE BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    29.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.065   PAY DATE   S16.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    LUX</p>
<p> NOTES	S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) 5-50</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/NETH ANT/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  0.875     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
